{"id":"administration","lemma":"administration","pos":"noun","rank":2685,"glosses":["management (administration; the process or practice of managing)"],"ipa":"/ad.mi.nis.tʁa.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/Fr-administration.ogg/Fr-administration.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"administrations"},"formAudio":{"administrations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-administrations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'administration a approuvé le budget.","en":"The administration approved the budget.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to approve of","l":"approuver"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"a budget"}]},{"text":"L'administration prend des décisions importantes.","en":"The administration makes important decisions.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"decision","l":"décision"},{"g":"important","l":"important"}]},{"text":"L'administration s'oppose à ces nouvelles taxes.","en":"The administration is opposed to these new taxes.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to oppose","l":"opposer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"tax","l":"taxe"}]},{"text":"Le conseil d'administration va discuter de la proposition mardi prochain.","en":"The board of directors is going to discuss the proposal next Tuesday.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"piece of advice"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to argue, to debate"},null,null,{"g":"proposition"},{"g":"Tuesday"},{"g":"upcoming"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"La pression est mise sur l'administration afin qu'elle trouve une nouvelle politique.","en":"The heat is on the administration to come up with a new policy.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"pressure"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"placement"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g"